-\subsection{Training state and reproducibility checks}
-\label{app:repro-recovery}
-
-Training continuation requires a consistent checkpoint of model weights
-and the optimizer, bank, token, cursor, and request-stream state in
-App.~\ref{app:algorithm-control}. State mismatches, non-finite values,
-missing completion evidence, changed dataset identities, and mismatched
-source or aggregate hashes fail validation. Moving a run between devices
-must preserve the configured update and checkpoint state; this alone
-does not guarantee bitwise-identical execution. Reported analyses use the
